{"symbol":"AHASOLAR","yahoo":"AHASOLAR.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Ahasolar Technologies Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","website":"https://www.ahasolar.in","about":"Ahasolar Technologies Limited develops a software as a service for solar companies to streamline the processes in India. It operates through Solar Software Service; Solar Marketplace; Solar Advisory and Consultancy Service; and Development of Solar Power Plant. The company provides Aha Solar helper, a project management software and a software for solar PV installers to manage and design projects; Aha marketplace which buys and sells solar products and services; Aha Advisory, which includes transaction advisory and technical consultancy for RE projects; and Aha Energy for fractional ownership of RE assets and decentralized solar scale. It also offers solar calculator, a common platform for end consumers and Solar PV Installers. The company was formerly known as AHAsolar Technologies Private Limited. Ahasolar Technologies Limited was founded in 2017 and is based in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:06:54+00:00","quote":{"price":70.0,"prevClose":70.0,"marketCap":21.57,"high52":109.9,"low52":58.9,"pe":104.48,"bookValue":48.59,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":1.38,"shares":0.3082,"insiders":64.64,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-07-21","2023-07-24","2023-07-25","2023-07-26","2023-07-27","2023-07-28","2023-07-31","2023-08-01","2023-08-02","2023-08-03","2023-08-04","2023-08-07","2023-08-08","2023-08-09","2023-08-10","2023-08-11","2023-08-14","2023-08-16","2023-08-17","2023-08-18","2023-08-21","2023-08-22","2023-08-23","2023-08-24","2023-08-25","2023-08-28","2023-08-29","2023-08-30","2023-08-31","2023-09-01","2023-09-04","2023-09-05","2023-09-06","2023-09-07","2023-09-08","2023-09-11","2023-09-12","2023-09-13","2023-09-14","2023-09-15","2023-09-18","2023-09-20","2023-09-21","2023-09-22","2023-09-25","2023-09-26","2023-09-27","2023-09-28","2023-09-29","202